<title>USA: Investor group cuts Inacom stake.</title>
<headline>Investor group cuts Inacom stake.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1996-09-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>A group including investors Rick and Joseph Inatome said Monday they reduced their stake in Inacom Corp to 4.4 percent or 446,464 common shares.</p>
<p>In a filing with the Securities and Exchange Commission, the group said it sold 80,000 shares of Inacom between August 5 and September 3 at prices ranging from $22.50 to $27.125 a share.</p>
<p>The group did not specify any reasons for the latest transactions.</p>
